                Verified Domestic Kitchens
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-1.5 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed"
               x-text="$store.app.language === 'ar' ? 'اكتشف أمهر طهاة الأكل البيتي في حيك للاستلام المباشر' : 'Explore vetted domestic chefs cooking authentic recipes in your neighborhood'">
                Explore vetted domestic chefs cooking authentic recipes in your neighborhood
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 space-y-8">
